{{Term/Store|Armored Porgy|Armored Porgies|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Armored Porgy}}
Armored Porgies are saltwater [[Fish]] that can be found in the waters of the [[Necluda Sea]] and [[Lanayru Sea]]. They are also sold by [[Mubs]] at the fish market in [[Lurelin Village]] and by the traveling [[Merchant]] [[Chumin]]. As is the case with both Armored Porgies and [[Mighty Porgy|Mighty Porgies]], they can be chilled by [[Ice]] to make [[Frozen Porgy|Frozen Porgies]] or burned by [[Fire]] to make [[Roasted Porgy|Roasted Porgies]]. [[Link]] can eat one raw to restore one of his [[Heart]]s. They have hard scales with a compound that, when [[Cooking|Cooked]], will make a [[Meal]] that temporarily grants Link [[Defense Up]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

